      "label_definition": "positive = the (bank, account) entity is the payer or the payee of at least one transaction whose published 'Is Laundering' flag is 1. IBM labels transactions; this entity label is derived, and it makes a launderer's counterparty positive as well",
      "synthetic": true,
      "notes": [
        "SYNTHETIC: IBM AMLworld virtual-world simulator (Altman et al., NeurIPS 2023 Datasets and Benchmarks). Not evidence about real-world detection.",
